---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import logo from '../assets/generated/nagi-logo-sumi-v1.png';
import { site, navigation } from '../data/site';
import Arrow from './Arrow.astro';
---
<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="container footer-main"><a href="#top" class="footer-brand" aria-label="凪 居酒屋 トップへ"><Image src={logo} alt="凪 居酒屋" width={100} /></a><p>米と魚、今夜は凪で。<br /><span>日暮里駅直結・徒歩1分</span></p><nav aria-label="フッターナビゲーション">{navigation.map((item) => <a href={item.href}>{item.label}</a>)}<a href={site.tabelog} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">食べログで予約<Arrow diagonal /></a><a href={site.instagram} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Instagram<Arrow diagonal /></a></nav></div>
  <div class="container footer-bottom"><small>© {new Date().getFullYear()} 凪 居酒屋</small><a href="#top">ページの先頭へ <span>↑</span></a></div>
</footer>
<div class="mobile-actions" aria-label="ご予約とアクセス"><a href={site.telephoneHref}><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="19" height="19" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m7 3 3 5-2 2c1 3 3 5 6 6l2-2 5 3-1 4C11 22 2 13 3 4l4-1Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" /></svg><span>電話で予約</span></a><a href={site.map} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M19 10c0 5-7 11-7 11S5 15 5 10a7 7 0 1 1 14 0Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" /><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="2.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" /></svg><span>地図・アクセス</span></a></div>
